- epoca-pvm-host.wasm
- pvm-wasm-translated.js
- pvm-wasm-worker-entry.js
- pvm-gpu-worker.js
- pvm-wasm-worker.js (generated bundle)

Local adaptation:
- scripts/build-pvm-worker.ts generates pvm-wasm-worker.js by concatenating
  pvm-wasm-translated.js and pvm-wasm-worker-entry.js so it also works inside
  opaque sandbox workers where importScripts cannot resolve URLs.
- The worker entry reports translation, compilation, startup, and update timing
  metrics and returns translated Wasm bytes for the sandbox's digest-keyed
  IndexedDB cache.
- The translated runtime implements the bounded Tri2D and WebGPU Raster
  hostcalls while retaining the interpreter as a guarded fallback.
